    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Vomiting, now settled; watery diarrhea; cramps; no blood or black stools</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low-grade fever and aching; thirsty</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Passing urine, though less than usual</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Contamination fears and washing worse with the illness; mood steady; no suicidal thoughts</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

