    <td>Obsessive-compulsive disorder, severe (Y-BOCS 28), with good insight: contamination, symmetry, and number obsessions; washing, counting, repeating in threes, and calculating compulsions; synthetic modern diagnosis linked to his own accounts of counting and calculating rituals and aversions</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
